Subject: [PATCH 02/20] seo(schema): make JSON-LD match visible content and
 verified credentials
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Phase 14 batch B2 (audit 2026-09-01, Phase 10):
- Product: name = visible H1; drop invented sku/productID/mpn, inLanguage,
  audience; offers gated behind PRODUCT_OFFERS_ENABLED=false (indicative
  price ranges stay page text only — owner decision 2026-09-02)
- FAQPage only for FAQs actually rendered on the page (no synthetic feed)
- Article/authority markup only on article routes (blog/guides/compare/...)
- Organization: legal name Shenzhen Proud Tek Co., Ltd, full postal address,
  sameAs without WhatsApp deep link, numberOfEmployees removed; hasCredential
  (3 CAIC ISO certificates) emitted on /about/certifications/ only
- WebPage typed AboutPage on /about/* (except legal pages)
- machine mirrors: byline/reviewer resolved via resolveEditorialByline
